{"unit_id":"iguowz__dsh-cortex#card-zh","repo":"iguowz/dsh-cortex","commit":"e2a9acacf7255678220dd927c4348db03851d6d7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cortex 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的多模型任务编排插件。它把 Cortex 引擎接入智能体工具和 /cortex 命令，并可启动本机 Web 控制台。用户可创建任务、递归拆解工作、按任务画像和模型能力路由子任务、审核结果并对失败任务执行恢复；插件还提供模型评测、策略复用、成本与 KPI 统计、任务追踪及可选的看门狗定时循环。适合需要把复杂工作分派给不同模型并跟踪质量和成本的 DSH 用户。默认补丁开启 127.0.0.1:8788 控制台；运行需 DSH 的 commands/tools 及可用模型配置，未发现必须配置的 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:20-45","lib/tools.js:919-935","lib/service.js:2569-2625"]}
{"unit_id":"iguowz__dsh-cortex#card-en","repo":"iguowz/dsh-cortex","commit":"e2a9acacf7255678220dd927c4348db03851d6d7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cortex is a DSH plugin for multi-model task orchestration. It decomposes tasks, routes subtasks, reviews results, recovers failures, evaluates models, and tracks costs. An optional local console displays task and model data at 127.0.0.1:8788.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:20-45","lib/tools.js:919-935","lib/service.js:2569-2625"]}
